{"slug":"server-information-charshop-block.32427","sourceUrl":"https://cerberus-games.com/threads/server-information-charshop-block.32427/","title":"[Informações do servidor] Charshop Block","bodyHtml":"<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"31.png\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/31-png.36537/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/31-png.36537/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"31.png\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"31.png\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"1158\" height=\"262\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div></div><br />\noriginal thread(ru) - <a href=\"https://cerberus-games.com/threads/%D0%9E%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5-%D0%94%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F-%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BA%D0%B0-charshop.32387/\" class=\"link link--internal\">*link*</a><br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Charshop Block is a new feature that allows you to voluntarily block the &quot;charshop&quot; sale of your character through a web auction.</span><br />\n<br />\n\n\n<div class=\"bbCodeSpoiler\">\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"bbCodeSpoiler-button button--longText button\" data-xf-click=\"toggle\" data-xf-init=\"tooltip\" title=\"Нажмите для открытия или закрытия спойлера\"><span class=\"button-text\">\n\n\t\t<span>Спойлер: <span class=\"bbCodeSpoiler-button-title\">How to block sale of the character</span></span>\n\t</span></button>\n\t<div class=\"bbCodeSpoiler-content\">\n\t\t<div class=\"bbCodeBlock bbCodeBlock--spoiler\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bbCodeBlock-content\">1. Open Profile Menu<br />\n<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"Step 1t.png\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-1t-png.36462/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-1t-png.36462/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Step 1t.png\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Step 1t.png\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"262\" height=\"421\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n2. Open Profile<br />\n<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"Step 2t.png\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-2t-png.36463/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-2t-png.36463/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Step 2t.png\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Step 2t.png\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"325\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div><br />\n<br />\n<br />\n3. Open Characters Tab<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"Step 3t.png\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-3t-png.36464/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-3t-png.36464/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Step 3t.png\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Step 3t.png\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"939\" height=\"441\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div><br />\n<br />\n4. On the character tab you want to block CharShop sale choose &quot;LOCK CHARACTER SELL&quot;<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"Step 4t.png\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-4t-png.36465/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-4t-png.36465/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Step 4t.png\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Step 4t.png\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"934\" height=\"503\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div><br />\n<br />\n5. Specify the blocking period in days (Minimum - 1 day, Maximum - 60 days) and click &quot;LOCK CHARACTER SELL&quot;<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"Step 5.PNG\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-5-png.36466/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/step-5-png.36466/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Step 5.PNG\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Step 5.PNG\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"534\" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div><br />\n\n\n<div class=\"bbCodeSpoiler\">\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"bbCodeSpoiler-button button--longText button\" data-xf-click=\"toggle\" data-xf-init=\"tooltip\" title=\"Нажмите для открытия или закрытия спойлера\"><span class=\"button-text\">\n\n\t\t<span>Спойлер: <span class=\"bbCodeSpoiler-button-title\">Check Charshop block of Another User/Member</span></span>\n\t</span></button>\n\t<div class=\"bbCodeSpoiler-content\">\n\t\t<div class=\"bbCodeBlock bbCodeBlock--spoiler\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bbCodeBlock-content\">1) Open menu &quot;BEST PLAYERS AND GUILDS&quot;<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"bbImageWrapper  js-lbImage\" title=\"6.png\"\n\t\tdata-src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/6-png.36467/\" data-lb-sidebar-href=\"\" data-lb-caption-extra-html=\"\" data-single-image=\"1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://cerberus-games.com/attachments/6-png.36467/\"\n\t\t\tdata-url=\"\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"bbImage\"\n\t\t\tdata-zoom-target=\"1\"\n\t\t\tstyle=\"\"\n\t\t\talt=\"6.png\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"6.png\"\n\t\t\twidth=\"1205\" height=\"433\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t</div><br />\n2) In opened menu - Find guild and open &quot;SHOW CURRENT MEMBERS&quot;<br />\n<br />\n3) In open window - Find character and check &quot;char lock state&quot;</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>"}